<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="162143538"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:28.133"><div begin="25.585" end="51.312" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="25.585" end="30.148" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.585" end="28.359">不做考虑也没半</span><span begin="28.359" end="29.185">点</span><span begin="29.185" end="29.587">犹</span><span begin="29.587" end="30.148">豫</span></p><p begin="31.849" end="36.540" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.849" end="34.127">我就说了这一</span><span begin="34.127" end="34.654">句</span> <span begin="34.933" end="35.363">我</span><span begin="35.363" end="35.767">等</span><span begin="35.767" end="36.540">你</span></p><p begin="38.060" end="42.755" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.060" end="40.009">你眼中闪过</span><span begin="40.009" end="40.461">了</span><span begin="40.461" end="40.680">一</span><span begin="40.680" end="41.615">些</span><span begin="41.615" end="42.023">讶</span><span begin="42.023" end="42.755">异</span></p><p begin="43.511" end="46.203" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.511" end="45.509">更多的是怀</span><span begin="45.509" end="46.203">疑</span></p><p begin="46.590" end="51.312" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.590" end="48.189">所以你可</span><span begin="48.189" end="48.860">以</span><span begin="49.754" end="50.076">离</span><span begin="50.076" end="51.312">去</span></p></div><div begin="56.774" end="1:23.259" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="56.774" end="1:01.381" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.774" end="59.050">不相信你还会</span><span begin="59.050" end="59.345">回</span><span begin="59.345" end="1:00.237">心</span><span begin="1:00.237" end="1:00.694">转</span><span begin="1:00.694" end="1:01.381">意</span></p><p begin="1:02.928" end="1:07.726" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.928" end="1:05.338">是我任性才决</span><span begin="1:05.338" end="1:05.720">定</span> <span begin="1:06.096" end="1:06.924">要等</span><span begin="1:06.924" end="1:07.726">你</span></p><